# Dependencies & caches
**/node_modules/
**/__pycache__/
**/.venv/
**/venv/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/dist/
**/build/
**/.vite/

# Lock / generated noise
**/package-lock.json
**/*.pyc

# Local secrets (never feed into context casually)
**/.env
**/.env.local

# Binary / large design assets
**/*.png
**/*.jpg
**/*.jpeg
**/*.pdf
**/*.pen

# Ignore feature plans from global search (explicit @ when needed)
docs/plans/*.md
